<p style="margin-top:0;">Hello,</p>
<p>Here's the HardPoint invoice for <strong><%= @account.name %></strong>: <%= @invoice.description %>.</p>
<p style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700;"><%= money(@invoice.amount_cents, currency: @invoice.currency) %> due by <%= @invoice.due_on.to_fs(:long) %></p>
<p>The invoice is attached. Pay by M-Pesa or card from the Billing page.</p>
<%= render "billing_mailer/pay" %>
